<title>JAPAN: Daiichi Ken plans share split.</title>
<headline>Daiichi Ken plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiichi Kensetsu said on Monday it planned a 1.12-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
</text>
